Linus,

please pull ALSA fixes for v2.6.31 from:

  git://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/tiwai/sound-2.6.git for-linus

Most of the changes here are trivial fixes, in addition to deadlock
fixes in SB X-Fi driver and a 2.6.30 regression fix for intel8x0
driver.


Thanks!

Takashi

